#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmines; is the classic Minesweeper game. The idea is to uncover all the "
"squares without blowing up any mines. When a mine is blown up, the game is "
"over. Numbers indicate how many mines there are nearby."
msgstr ""
"&kmines; je obična Minesweeper igra. Ideja je da se otkriju svi kvadratići a "
"da vas mina ne raznese. Kada mina ekspodira, igra je gotova. Brojevi "
"pokazuju koliko mina ima u blizini."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Uputstva za igranje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locate all the mines hidden on the minefield."
msgstr "Locirajte sve mine skrivene u minskom polju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To play &kmines;, you need to use the mouse and its three buttons to uncover "
"or to flag the squares (with two-buttoned mice, clicking the &MMB; is "
"generally achieved by simultaneously pressing the &LMB; and the &RMB; "
"buttons)."
msgstr ""
"Za igranje &kmines;, trebate koristiti miš i njegove tri tipke da otkrijete "
"ili označite zastavicom kvadratić (za miševe sa dvije tipke, klikanjem na "
"&MMB;  se uglavnom postiže klikanjem na &LMB;  i &RMB; tipke)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking the &LMB; on your mouse will uncover a square. If there is a mine "
"there, it will detonate, and the game will be over. If there is not a mine "
"under the square, the square is cleared and if there aren't other mines "
"nearby, the square will disappear including any nearby squares without "
"mines. If there are mines nearby, a number will appear showing how many "
"neighboring squares contain mines. For each square (excluding edge and "
"corner squares), there are eight neighboring squares."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na&LMB; tipku miše će otkriti kvadratić. Ako je tu mina, ona će se "
"detonirati, i igra će biti gotova. Ako nema mine ispod datog kvadratića, "
"kvadrat je čist i ako nema u blizini mina, kvadrat će nestati uključujući da "
"sve ostalim kvadratima gdje nema mina. Ako imaju mine u blizini, pojavit će "
"se broj koji pokazuje koliko ih je u okolini tog kvadrata. Za svaki kvadrat "
"(bez rubova), postoji osam susjednih kvadrata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "&LMB; clicking a flagged square is safe and does nothing."
msgstr "&LMB; klikom na kvadrat označen zastavom je siguran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &RMB; will mark a square as containing a mine (by placing a red flag on "
"it). Clicking the button twice will set it as being uncertain (by placing a "
"question mark on it). The uncertain tag can be useful when you are puzzled "
"about the positions of mines. The &MMB; will clear the surrounding squares "
"if the right number of squares is already flagged. It is very useful since "
"it is much quicker than uncovering all individual squares. Make sure your "
"flags are correctly placed, if not, you might detonate a mine."
msgstr ""
"&RMB; će selektovati kvadrat kao da je ispod mina (postavljanjem crvene "
"zastave na njega). Dvostrukim klikom na kvadrat će se označiti kao nesigurno "
"polje (postavljanjem znaka upitnika na njega). Znak upitnika može biti "
"koristan kada ne znate poziviju mine. &MMB; će očistiti okolne kvadrate ako "
"je pravi broj kvadrata označen zastavom. Veoma je korisno jer je brže nego "
"otkrivanje pojedinačnih kvadrata. Provjerite da li je zastava ispravno "
"postavljena, ako nije, detonirat će minu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila Igre, Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "All the mines have to be cleared before a player can win a game."
msgstr "Sve mine moraju biti očišćene prije nego igrač pobjedi u igri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player cannot know the exact location of the mines before the game is "
"over."
msgstr "Igrač ne može znati tačnu lokaciju mina prije nego se igra završi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "If a mine is detonated, the game is over."
msgstr "Ako je mina detonirana, igra je gotova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Numbers will indicate nearby mines."
msgstr "Brojevi ukazuju na mine u blizini."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the numbers to find out where nearby mines are."
msgstr "Korisite brojeve da otkrijete gdje je mina u blizini."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Place flags where you suspect there are mines. Note that even though the "
"indicated number of mines goes down when you place a flag, there might not "
"be a mine under the flag."
msgstr ""
"Postavite zastave gdje sumnjate da bi mogla biti mina. Imajte na umu da iako "
"je označen broj mina kada postavite zastavu, mina može biti ispod te zastave."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Think before you click, a wrong click could detonate a mine."
msgstr ""
"Razmislite prije nego što kliknete, pogrešan klik može detonirati minu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you suspect that a square contains a mine, work around the square to "
"uncover any numbers which might help."
msgstr ""
"Kada sumnjate da kvadrat sadrži minu, radite oko kvadrata da otkrijete broj "
"koji bi vam mogao pomoći."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to clear the board as quickly as possible, the less time you spend, the "
"higher your score will be."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte očisiti polje što je brže moguće, što manje vremena potrošite, "
"veći će biti rezultat."

