#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new game."
msgstr "Pokretanje nove igre."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pauses the game time. Click on the menu item again to make the game resume. "
"Note that the board disappears when the game is paused as it would be unfair "
"if you could search for good moves without the time pressure."
msgstr ""
"Pauzira igru. Kliknite na meni da nastavite igru. Imajte na umu da tabla za "
"igru nestaje kada je igra pauzirana da bi bilo fer ako bi htjeli da "
"procjenite dobre poteze bez pritiska zbog vremena."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži rekorde</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This shows you the high score (the shortest time) for each difficulty level."
msgstr "Ovo pokazuje najbolji rezultat(najkraće vrijeme) za svaku težinu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kmines;"
msgstr "<action>Quits</action> &kmines;"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you set the difficulty level from a sub-menu."
msgstr "Omogućava vam da podesite težinu nivoa iz podizbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are three default levels of difficulty: <guimenuitem>Easy</"
"guimenuitem> (9x9 squares, 10 mines), <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> "
"(16x16 squares, 40 mines), and <guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> (30x16 "
"squares, 99 mines). There is also a <guimenuitem>Custom</guimenuitem> level "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri težine nivoa: <guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem> (9x9 kvadrati, 10 "
"mina), <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> (16x16 kvadrati, 40 mina), and "
"<guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem> (30x16 kvadrati, 99 mina). Takođe postoji i  "
"<guimenuitem>Custom</guimenuitem> tećina nivoa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select <guimenuitem>Custom</guimenuitem>, then the settings you have "
"configured in the <guimenuitem>Configure &kmines;</guimenuitem> dialog will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete <guimenuitem>Custom</guimenuitem>, onda postavke koje imate "
"konfigurisane u  <guimenuitem>Configure &kmines;</guimenuitem> će se "
"iskorititi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kmines; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kmines; ima zajedniči &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> opcije, za više informacija pročitajte <ulink url="
"\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> and "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help Menu</ulink> of "
"the &kde; Fundamentals."

