#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I change the way the game looks?"
msgstr "Mogu li promijeniti izgled igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, click on the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu and select "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kmines;...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Da, kliknite na <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> meni i "
"odaberite<guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kmines;...</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is there a way to add more mines and squares?"
msgstr "Postoji li način da se doda još mina i kvadrata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, the easiest way is to use the drop down box in the lower right corner."
msgstr "Da, najlakši nalin je da korisite padajuću listu u donjem desnom uglu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Settings"
msgstr "Postavke igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game settings can be configured by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kmines;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar. A dialog will appear."
msgstr ""
"Postavke igre se mogu konfigurisati odabirom <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kmines;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz "
"menija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the second page, you can set the theme. Select a theme from the list. "
"Each item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A "
"selection is immediately applied."
msgstr ""
"Na drugoj stranici, možete promjeniti izgled teme. Odaberite temu iz liste. "
"Svaka stvaka u listi će prikazati mali pregled lijevo od imena teme. "
"Selekcija će se odma učitati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the third page, you can set the height and width of the board and the "
"number of mines in your custom level."
msgstr ""
"Na trećoj stranici, možete promjeniti visinu i žirinu ploče za igranu i broj "
"mina za vlastiti nivo."

